OL,3,GNEWSADrought leaves woman without
OL,4,Arunning water for first time in 30
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FGenista Tanner never imagined she would
OL,8,Fbe left without running water in the
OL,9,Fhome she has lived in for three
OL,10,Fdecades.
OL,12,FThe 72-year-old, who lives in rural
OL,13,FCeredigion, relies on a well for her
OL,14,Fwater supply. But for the first time in
OL,15,F30 years, the well has run dry.
OL,17,FTanner is one of more than 100,000
OL,18,Fpeople across Wales who rely on private
OL,19,Fwater supplies, according to the
OL,20,FBritish Geological Survey.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
